From: Shirogane Tsumugi <artoriapendragon123@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] drm/sun4i: wire up drm_panic on the DE2 mixer layers

DRM_PANIC only works on planes that expose their scanout buffer to the
panic handler via get_scanout_buffer.  simpledrm already does, so a panic
lands on the screen for as long as the firmware framebuffer is up -- but
once S01app modprobes sun4i-drm and it takes over, panics go dark again.

The DE2 layers scan out of plain CMA dumb buffers (drm_gem_dma, linear,
kernel-mapped at creation), which is exactly the case the generic
drm_fb_dma_get_scanout_buffer helper handles, so hooking it up is all
that is needed.  The panic handler checks the framebuffer format at draw
time and skips planes it cannot draw on (e.g. a C8 indexed layer), so
advertising the hook on every layer is safe.

Signed-off-by: Shirogane Tsumugi <artoriapendragon123@gmail.com>

---
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_ui_layer.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_ui_layer.c
index 05ff64646..34db94ca3 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_ui_layer.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_ui_layer.c
@@ -276,6 +276,7 @@ static void sun8i_ui_layer_atomic_update(struct drm_plane *plane,
 static const struct drm_plane_helper_funcs sun8i_ui_layer_helper_funcs = {
 	.atomic_check	= sun8i_ui_layer_atomic_check,
 	.atomic_update	= sun8i_ui_layer_atomic_update,
+	.get_scanout_buffer = drm_fb_dma_get_scanout_buffer,
 };
 
 static const struct drm_plane_funcs sun8i_ui_layer_funcs = {
diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_vi_layer.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_vi_layer.c
index ea6c228f1..7ed4a63fd 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_vi_layer.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/sun4i/sun8i_vi_layer.c
@@ -303,6 +303,7 @@ static void sun8i_vi_layer_atomic_update(struct drm_plane *plane,
 static const struct drm_plane_helper_funcs sun8i_vi_layer_helper_funcs = {
 	.atomic_check	= sun8i_vi_layer_atomic_check,
 	.atomic_update	= sun8i_vi_layer_atomic_update,
+	.get_scanout_buffer = drm_fb_dma_get_scanout_buffer,
 };
 
 static const struct drm_plane_funcs sun8i_vi_layer_funcs = {
